  "title": "Spicy Shrimp Fettuccine with Garlic and Tomatoes",
  "description": "Shrimp are sauteed with garlic, tomatoes, parsley, lemon, and chile peppers and served over fettuccine or other pasta for a quick and tasty dinner.",
